        "cooked": "<p>There are existing links on the Internet (and in the Sentinels digital version) to the old forums, such as:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/fanatic-guide\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/fanatic-guide</a></p>\n<p>This redirects to:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.comtopic/fanatic-guide\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://forums.greaterthangames.comtopic/fanatic-guide</a></p>\n<p>Which is an invalid site (forums.greaterthangames.comtopic). It looks like it should try to redirect to:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/fanatic-guide\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/fanatic-guide</a></p>\n<p>Is it possible for the link redirection to be fixed?</p>",
