        "username": "Omegatron",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/omegatron/{size}/4904_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-07-14T09:12:22.730Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That’s caught most of them but there are some links that are still broken.</p>\n<p>For example:<br>\n<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-heros-guide-to-unity-3145\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-heros-guide-to-unity-3145</a></p>\n<p>That redirects to:<br>\n<a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-unity-3145\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-unity-3145</a></p>\n<p>Which is is still a broken link. But if the numerical suffix is removed (from either of those two links) it goes to the right place:<br>\n<a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-unity\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-unity</a></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p>There’s also some weird ones that I don’t know if they can be fixed:<br>\n<a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/heros-guide-absolute-zero\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/heros-guide-absolute-zero</a></p>\n<p>Redirects to:<br>\n<a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/heros-guide-absolute-zero\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/heros-guide-absolute-zero</a></p>\n<p>But is apparently supposed to go to:<br>\n<a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-absolute-zero\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-absolute-zero</a></p>\n<p>I can only assume the thread was renamed at some point.</p>\n<p>Certain punctuation also seems to be encoded differently now, this doesn’t work:<br>\n<a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/knyfe-strategy-guide\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/knyfe-strategy-guide</a></p>\n<p>But this does:<br>\n<a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/k-n-y-f-e-strategy-guide/\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/k-n-y-f-e-strategy-guide/</a></p>",
