        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "That's caught most of them but there are some links that are still broken. \n\nFor example:\nhttps://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/a-heros-guide-to-unity-3145\n\nThat redirects to:\nhttps://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-unity-3145\n\nWhich is is still a broken link. But if the numerical suffix is removed (from either of those two links) it goes to the right place:\nhttps://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-unity\n\n&nbsp;\n\nThere's also some weird ones that I don't know if they can be fixed:\nhttps://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/heros-guide-absolute-zero\n\nRedirects to:\nhttps://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/heros-guide-absolute-zero\n\nBut is apparently supposed to go to:\nhttps://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/a-heros-guide-to-absolute-zero\n\nI can only assume the thread was renamed at some point.\n\nCertain punctuation also seems to be encoded differently now, this doesn't work:\nhttps://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/knyfe-strategy-guide\n\nBut this does:\nhttps://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/k-n-y-f-e-strategy-guide/",
