        "created_at": "2021-07-14T12:27:18.246Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Yeah, given the difference between how “friendly” URLs are created between the old site and the new, it’s not always going to be an exact match. In a perfect world, all would be remapped but that’s awfully time consuming with the thousands of topics we have. In the short term, addressing those that are most common is probably the way to go.</p>",
