      {
        "id": 242805,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2022-02-18T14:23:27.534Z",
        "cooked": "<p><a class=\"mention\" href=\"/u/cajunjoel\">@cajunjoel</a> , did something change about the redirection? The Spirit Island FAQ has a number of links going to places like</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/repeating-powers-with-shadows-flicker-like-flame-10621\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/forum/topic/repeating-powers-with-shadows-flicker-like-flame-10621</a></p>\n<p>which now redirects to</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/topic/repeating-powers-with-shadows-flicker-like-flame-10621\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https://forums.greaterthangames.com/topic/repeating-powers-with-shadows-flicker-like-flame-10621</a></p>\n<p>rather than</p>\n<aside class=\"quote\" data-post=\"1\" data-topic=\"16997\">\n  <div class=\"title\">\n    <div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n    <img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\">\n    <a href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/t/repeating-powers-with-shadows-flicker-like-flame/16997\">Repeating powers with Shadows Flicker like Flame.</a> <a class=\"badge-category__wrapper \" href=\"/c/games/spirit-island/18\"><span data-category-id=\"18\" style=\"--category-badge-color: #3DBC01; --category-badge-text-color: #FFF; --parent-category-badge-color: #3AB54A;\" data-parent-category-id=\"73\" data-drop-close=\"true\" class=\"badge-category --has-parent\" title=\"General Discussion of Spirit Island\"><span class=\"badge-category__name\">Spirit Island</span></span></a>\n  </div>\n  <blockquote>\n    If Shadows Flicker like Flame uses Insatiable Hunger of the Swarm, paying extra to target land with Dahan, and meets the threshold to repeat in an adjacet land, can you instead choose to repeat in a land with Dahan? &nbsp;Would you repay the cost, or does the initial payment affect the repeat as well? We decided that the repeat is a seperate use and so you could apply shadows of the Dahan as long as you paid for it. &nbsp;\n  </blockquote>\n</aside>\n\n<p>(It also works without that numerical suffix.)</p>\n<p>There are also links like this one:</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://greaterthangames.com/comment/138345#comment-138345\" class=\"onebox\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://greaterthangames.com/comment/138345#comment-138345</a></p>\n<p>I’m guessing those are hopeless.</p>",
